synaScriber is a plugin for Synaplan (https://github.com/metadist/synaplan).
The default speech model used with it, primeline/whisper-large-v3-turbo-german
(Apache-2.0), is a fine-tune of OpenAI Whisper (MIT); it is served by
whisper.cpp (MIT) from the synaplan-stt image in
https://github.com/metadist/synaplan-charts.
